eory.Measure.map (A.stoppedHist O' X' Y') P')","decl":"Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le_stoppedHist"},"code":"/-- **Data processing for runs**: for two runs of the same identification algorithm, the\ndivergence between the laws of the outputs is at most the divergence between the laws of the\nhistories at the stopping time. -/\nlemma IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le_stoppedHist (h : A.IsRun env O X Y out P)\n    (h' : A.IsRun env' O' X' Y' out' P') :\n    klDiv (P.map out) (P'.map out') ≤\n      klDiv (P.map (A.stoppedHist O X Y)) (P'.map (A.stoppedHist O' X' Y'))","proof":":= by\n  rw [← h.klDiv_map_stoppedHist_out h']\n  have := klDiv_map_le (P.map fun ω ↦ (A.stoppedHist O X Y ω, out ω))\n    (P'.map fun ω ↦ (A.stoppedHist O' X' Y' ω, out' ω)) measurable_snd\n  rwa [AEMeasurable.map_map_of_aemeasurable measurable_snd.aemeasurable\n    h.hasCondDistrib_output.aemeasurable, AEMeasurable.map_map_of_aemeasurable\n    measurable_snd.aemeasurable h'.hasCondDistrib_output.aemeasurable] at this","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/RunDivergence.lean","start":55,"end":67,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/RunDivergence.lean#L55-L67"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Fin","lean4","structure"],["InformationTheory.klDiv","mathlib","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.stoppedHist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.Round","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.pi","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsZeroOrProbabi