ite stopping times, the divergence between the laws of the outputs is at most\nthe expected sum, along the first run, of the divergences of the reward kernels at the actions\nplayed before stopping. -/\nlemma IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le_lintegral [MeasurableSpace.CountablyGenerated 𝓨]\n    (h : A.IsRun (stationaryEnv κ) O X Y out P) (h' : A.IsRun (stationaryEnv κ') O' X' Y' out' P')\n    (hτ : ∀ᵐ ω ∂P, A.stoppingTime O X Y ω ≠ ⊤) (hτ' : ∀ᵐ ω ∂P', A.stoppingTime O' X' Y' ω ≠ ⊤) :\n    klDiv (P.map out) (P'.map out') ≤\n      ∫⁻ ω, ∑ t ∈ range (A.stoppingTime O X Y ω).toNat, klDiv (κ (X t ω)) (κ' (X t ω)) ∂P","proof":":=\n  (h.klDiv_map_out_le_stoppedHist h').trans_eq\n    (h.isAlgEnvSeq.klDiv_map_stoppedValue_sigmaHistory h'.isAlgEnvSeq A.measurableSet_stopSet\n      hτ hτ')","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/RunDivergence.lean","start":86,"end":98,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/RunDivergence.lean#L86-L98"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["ENat","mathlib","definition"],["ENat.toNat","mathlib","definition"],["Filter.Eventually","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.range","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["InformationTheory.klDiv","mathlib","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.stoppingTime","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.stationaryEnv","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.CountablyGenerated","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsZeroOrProbabilityMeasure.toIsFiniteMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["M